TASK 2: latesttweets.sh & Crontab Configuration
- Purpose: Finds all files created under ~/TWEETS during the last 5 minutes (-mmin -5), appends their contents to ~/ALLTWEETS.out, and deletes (rm -f) the exact files that were appended.
- Script Content:
    #!/bin/bash
    mkdir -p ~/TWEETS
    touch ~/ALLTWEETS.out

    # Append files created in the last 5 minutes to ~/ALLTWEETS.out and delete them
    find ~/TWEETS -type f -name "*.out" -mmin -5 | xargs -r -i sh -c 'cat "{}" >> ~/ALLTWEETS.out && rm -f "{}"'
